Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.85,0:00:45.39,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&H404B4E&\4c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H0A686E&}曾相信哭泣是种任性
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:53.99,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&H404B4E&\4c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H0A686E&}奔跑穿过色调单一的小巷
