Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:07.42,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&H404B4E&\4c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H0A686E&}明知是虚幻的宿命
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:12.09,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\c&HB28703&\4c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H816610&}无论如何强烈祈愿
